  "description": "The Izoard all-round road bike features a comprehensively redesigned high-tech carbon frame. Its completely new design adopts the clean, dynamic styling of our most successful custom road bikes. The front of the bike unmistakably bears the DNA of the Arcalis Aero Bike: A head tube tapering towards the centre optimises aerodynamics whilst ensuring a fresh, modern look. The rear triangle, in turn, benefits from the strengths of our popular Xenith Endurance Bike: comfort-oriented marathon performance, including a 27.2 mm seatpost that effectively absorbs shocks and reduces fatigue over long distances. The maximum tyre clearance of 32 mm offers additional comfort reserves. With its new, ‘relaxed’ aero geometry – also inspired by the Xenith platform – and a targeted very low overall weight, the Izoard is perfect for long rides and fast training laps alike. Another highlight: the bike comes as standard with a frame bag developed in collaboration with Vaude, featuring a Fidlock magnetic mount. This means spare inner tubes or energy bars are always within easy reach. The Izoard 105 comes with a full Shimano 105 groupset – ideal for ambitious amateur cyclists who want a straightforward, reliable drivetrain.",
